@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness;performance] independent-city-surface-piece-products
The five production city surface splits MUST export independently from their exact
source bytes and consumed triangle/bounds/collision metadata. A source change MUST
NOT regenerate or retire a sibling source's output. Source subdivision MUST preserve
every corner/normal/UV/colour/material and placement frame. Every emitted render piece
MUST contain at most 32768 triangles, and each whole authored UCX hull MUST have one
piece owner. Complete assembly MUST precede native parent retirement; partitioning
MUST NOT introduce a second layer of duplicate city tiles.
The splitter MUST require explicit source selection, reject unsafe or case-fold
duplicate names and check every selected manifest entry before output mutation.
Production membership MUST remain in recipe/product/runtime admission, so adding
a family MUST NOT change unchanged siblings' splitter code or selected digests.
